# AI Agent Rules - Read-Only / Advisory Mode
# AI Agent Rules - Permission-Based Writing Mode

Strict Rule: DO NOT write, edit, overwrite, create, or delete any source code files in this repository.
The AI must act strictly as an advisor, tutor, and code reviewer.
Provide code snippets in the chat for reference only.
The user will manually write and implement all code.

The AI agent operates in Advisory Mode by default, but is AUTHORIZED to create and modify files when the user gives explicit permission in the conversation.
Always adhere strictly to the scope permitted by the user.
